{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大家記得十多年前左右，香港曾經興起過以「廁所」為主題的cafe嗎？現在韓國都找得到，更是升級版！被稱為「馬桶王國」、佔地足足 15,000 坪嘅韓國首個馬桶主題超獵奇cafe。最出名嘅莫過於由 1,500 個馬桶堆砌而成嘅「超大型馬桶塔」，場內仲展出了黃金馬桶、足球造型馬桶等各種奇形怪狀嘅特色馬桶，好搞笑！</p><p>除咗展覽，咖啡廳嘅餐點亦貫徹主題——只要點雪糕或 Affogato，就會用迷你馬桶造型嘅杯盛載送上！甚至連洗手間都特別打造成金碧輝煌嘅「黃金廁所」。現場仲設有餐廳提供意粉、Pizza 同意大利飯，玩味十足！</p><p>Lavacro Cafe（라바크로 카페） 地址： 忠清北道陰城郡大所面大東路537番吉 102 營業時間： 10:00 – 23:00</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611849134972498_11914654136a76015b9f21c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611849325572653_11552087896a76015d6f8eb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611849500164846_5889666776a76015f939e5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611849813229155_6069864356a76016275dff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611850047433143_2308104746a760165e0b85.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611850758676207_1965420326a76016bbcae4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178611850903432726_6061717716a76016d3f3a5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.296313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":400,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}